#: ../../about.rst:1
msgid "About this manual"
msgstr "关于本手册"

#: ../../about.rst:4
msgid ""
"This manual describes the implemented tool and its deliberate limits. The "
"separate GDS project records proposals, decisions, and review history. A "
"proposal's state is not changed by making its typography better."
msgstr "本手册介绍已经实现的工具，以及有意保留的限制。独立的 GDS 项目记录提案、决策和评审历史。改善排版并不会改变提案的状态。"

#: ../../about.rst:8
msgid ""
"The organization follows a practical documentation pattern: learn with "
"tutorials, understand with topic guides, act with practical tasks, and "
"check details in reference pages. Internals explain the invariants and "
"proofs."
msgstr "本手册按实际使用过程组织：通过教程入门，通过专题理解原理，通过操作指南完成任务，再查阅参考资料核对细节。内部实现部分解释不变量和证明。"

#: ../../about.rst:12
msgid ""
"The prose favors small examples, named assumptions, and direct "
"statements. The aim is an explanation that another person can test. The "
"design uses restrained color, strong headings, serif reading text, and "
"accessible navigation. It does not imitate an author's words or layout."
msgstr ""
"行文以小例子、明确的假设和直接的陈述为主。目标是让读者能够检验解释是否成立。页面采用克制的配色、醒目的标题、适合阅读的衬线字体，以及易于使用的导航。它并不模仿任何作者的措辞或版式。"

#: ../../about.rst:17
msgid ""
"This project was created with ``guidedog quickstart`` and is built by "
"Guidedog. RST holds the prose. Graphviz holds the diagrams. LaTeX math "
"notation holds equations. Typst remains only where a PDF typesetting "
"template is required."
msgstr ""
"本项目通过 ``guidedog quickstart`` 创建，并由 Guidedog 构建。正文使用 RST，图表使用 "
"Graphviz，公式使用 LaTeX 数学记法。只有 PDF 排版模板仍使用 Typst。"

#: ../../about.rst:21
msgid "Implementation"
msgstr "实现"

#: ../../about.rst:24
msgid "Guidedog 0.7 is a port of the original Odin implementation to Rust. The port keeps the user-facing behavior: the ``guidedog`` commands and options, ``conf.toml`` keys, directives, roles, and output. It redesigns the inside the way a Rust program is written: ownership instead of arenas and allocation budgets, traits instead of procedure tables, and one crate per responsibility. :doc:`internals/index` describes the result. :doc:`internals/engine-api-map` maps the Odin engine's names to the Rust ones."
msgstr "Guidedog 0.7 是把原先的 Odin 实现移植到 Rust 的版本。移植保留了面向用户的行为：``guidedog`` 命令和选项、``conf.toml`` 键、指令、角色以及输出。内部则按 Rust 程序的写法重新设计：用所有权取代内存池（arena）和分配预算，用 trait 取代过程表，每个 crate 只负责一件事。:doc:`internals/index` 介绍了重新设计的结果，:doc:`internals/engine-api-map` 列出了 Odin 引擎的名称与 Rust 名称的对应关系。"

#: ../../about.rst:32
msgid "The port adds Rust API documentation (:doc:`rust`), plugins linked into a custom binary (:doc:`plugins`), and a guided GitHub Pages workflow (:doc:`howto/github-pages`). Odin remains a documented language: the Odin domain and its API pages are unchanged (:doc:`odin`)."
msgstr "移植还新增了 Rust API 文档（:doc:`rust`）、链接进自定义二进制文件的插件（:doc:`plugins`），以及引导式的 GitHub Pages 工作流（:doc:`howto/github-pages`）。Odin 仍是受支持的文档语言：Odin 领域及其 API 页面保持不变（:doc:`odin`）。"

#: ../../about.rst:37
msgid "Build evidence and qualification"
msgstr "构建与验证记录"

#: ../../about.rst:40
msgid "Release 0.6.3 of the Odin implementation passed its integration and library suites, AddressSanitizer checks, five-platform builds and smoke tests, and twelve large-manual builds across CPython, Django, and Flask. Diagnostic and link results matched their established baselines. Those records are kept in the repository's ``docs/manual/evidence`` folder as history. The Rust implementation keeps the conformance tests and expected outputs (:doc:`internals/rst-conformance`, :doc:`internals/commonmark-conformance`). Its own large-manual measurements are recorded as new evidence."
msgstr "Odin 实现的 0.6.3 版通过了集成测试和库测试套件、AddressSanitizer 检查、五个平台的构建与冒烟测试，以及 CPython、Django 和 Flask 的十二次大型手册构建。诊断和链接结果均与既定基线一致。这些记录作为历史资料保存在仓库的 ``docs/manual/evidence`` 文件夹中。Rust 实现保留了一致性测试及其预期输出（:doc:`internals/rst-conformance`、:doc:`internals/commonmark-conformance`）。它自己的大型手册测量结果作为新的证据另行记录。"

#: ../../about.rst:49
msgid "Qualification checks (via ``guidedog plugin check``) show that plugins work across process boundaries. Linked plugins remain trusted code."
msgstr "资格检查（通过 ``guidedog plugin check``）表明插件可以跨进程边界工作。链接进程序的插件仍属于受信任代码。"

#: ../../about.rst:52
msgid "That evidence supports the released tool and its documented surface. It is not a claim of universal Sphinx equivalence. See :doc:`compatibility` for the retained limits."
msgstr "这些证据支撑的是已发布的工具及其文档所述的功能，并不意味着与 Sphinx 完全等同。保留的限制见 :doc:`compatibility`。"

#: ../../about.rst:55
msgid ""
"Documentation maintenance commands are in :doc:`howto/maintain-docs`."
msgstr "文档维护命令见 :doc:`howto/maintain-docs`\\ 。"

